{% comment %}
  Alterpop — Product Card
  =======================
  The ONE product card for the whole theme. Replaces Dawn's `card-product`.
  Wireframe: sections 8a / 8b.  Design system: assets/tokens.css +
  assets/product-card.css (self-contained — does not use component-card.css).

  Accepts:
  - card_product:  {Object}  Product. If blank, a placeholder card is rendered.
  - section_id:    {String}  Owning section id (for unique element ids). Optional.
  - lazy_load:     {Boolean} Lazy-load the image. Default: true.
  - skip_styles:   {Boolean} Don't emit <link> to product-card.css (set true for
                             every card after the first in a loop). Default: false.
  - placeholder_image: {String} placeholder_svg name when there is no product.
  - hide_franchise:{Boolean} Force-hide the Franchise segment (Universe Room,
                             where it is redundant). Default: false.
  - product_view_context: {String} 'collection' | 'search' | 'recommendation' |
                             'universe-room'. 'universe-room' also hides Franchise.

  Presentation state is derived from a stock NUMBER already provided by the sync
  app (allowed client-side calculation). The sync runs every ~45 min, so the
  number can be stale — copy here never promises real-time accuracy; the real
  check happens at add-to-cart on the PDP, which Dawn already handles.

  Estados:
    Available (>10) ....... standard
    Limited   (1-10) ...... +8% image area, visible stock count
    Sold Out  (0) ......... 70% image opacity, outline "Notify Me" CTA
{% endcomment %}

{%- unless skip_styles -%}
  {{ 'product-card.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{%- endunless -%}

{%- liquid
  assign uid = section_id | default: 'ap'
  assign img_loading = 'lazy'
  if lazy_load == false
    assign img_loading = 'eager'
  endif
-%}

{%- if card_product == blank -%}
  {%- comment -%} No product bound (e.g. onboarding / empty collage slot). {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="ap-card ap-card--available" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="ap-card__media-link">
      <div class="ap-card__media">
        {{ placeholder_image | default: 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'ap-card__img ap-card__img--placeholder' }}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ap-card__body">
      <h3 class="ap-card__title"><span class="ap-card__title-link">{{ 'onboarding.product_title' | t }}</span></h3>
      <p class="ap-card__meta"></p>
      <div class="ap-card__price">{{ 1999 | money }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- else -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign variant = card_product.selected_or_first_available_variant
    assign is_tracked = false
    if variant.inventory_management != blank
      assign is_tracked = true
    endif
    assign qty = variant.inventory_quantity

    assign state = 'available'
    if card_product.available == false
      assign state = 'soldout'
    elsif is_tracked and qty > 0 and qty <= 10
      assign state = 'limited'
    endif

    # Metadata line — Height/Dimension. Comes from the sync app (ociostock).
    assign dimension = card_product.metafields.ociostock.dimensions.value

    assign title_id = 'ap-card-title-' | append: uid | append: '-' | append: card_product.id
  -%}

  <div class="ap-card ap-card--{{ state }}">
    <div class="ap-card__media-link">
      <div class="ap-card__media">
        {%- if card_product.featured_media -%}
          {{
            card_product.featured_media
            | image_url: width: 800
            | image_tag:
              loading: img_loading,
              class: 'ap-card__img',
              widths: '165, 220, 280, 360, 480, 600, 800',
              sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 280px, (min-width: 750px) 33vw, 50vw',
              alt: card_product.featured_media.alt | default: card_product.title | escape
          }}
        {%- else -%}
          {{ placeholder_image | default: 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'ap-card__img ap-card__img--placeholder' }}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ap-card__body">
      <h3 class="ap-card__title" id="{{ title_id }}">
        <a href="{{ card_product.url }}" class="ap-card__title-link">{{ card_product.title | escape }}</a>
      </h3>

      {%- comment -%}
        Metadata line: Franchise/Universe > Line (se aplicável) > Height/Dimension

        BLOQUEADO: aguarda app — Franchise/Universe.
          Não existe campo de franquia limpo vindo da app de sincronização.
          `metafields.ociostock.licence` é o nome de licença em bruto e
          multi-idioma ("El Señor De Los Anillos"); usar tags = inferência
          proibida; `custom.parent_collection` = estrutura antiga proibida.
          Quando a app fornecer o campo:
            <span class="ap-card__meta-franchise">{{ franchise }}</span>
            <span class="ap-card__meta-sep" aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
          Regra: Franchise nunca trunca; se faltar espaço cai a Line, não a
          Franchise. Omitir dentro da Universe Room — quando desbloquear,
          reactivar no {%- liquid -%} do topo:
            assign hide_fr = false
            if hide_franchise or product_view_context == 'universe-room'
              assign hide_fr = true
            endif
          e envolver o <span> da franquia em {%- unless hide_fr -%} … {%- endunless -%}.

        BLOQUEADO: aguarda app — Line (entidade Line + regra 3+ peças).
          Quando existir, entra a seguir à Franchise:
            <span class="ap-card__meta-line">{{ line }}</span>
            <span class="ap-card__meta-sep" aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <p class="ap-card__meta">
        {%- if dimension != blank -%}
          <span class="ap-card__meta-dim">{{ dimension | escape }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </p>

      {%- comment -%}
        BLOQUEADO: aguarda app — badge "Premium Piece".
        Depende da flag Impulse/Premium vinda da app. Quando existir:
          {%- if card_product.metafields.<ns>.<tier>.value == 'premium' -%}
            <span class="ap-card__badge">{{ 'products.card.premium_piece' | t }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
      {%- endcomment -%}

      {%- if state == 'limited' -%}
        <span class="ap-card__stock">
          {{- 'products.card.in_stock_count' | t: count: qty -}}
        </span>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="ap-card__price">
        {%- if card_product.price_varies -%}
          <span class="ap-card__price-from">{{ 'products.card.price_from' | t }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
        <span class="ap-card__price-current">{{ card_product.price | money }}</span>
        {%- if card_product.compare_at_price > card_product.price -%}
          <span class="ap-card__price-compare">{{ card_product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
          <span class="ap-card__sr">{{ 'products.card.on_sale' | t }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        Card CTA = navigation to the PDP, NOT a purchase action. Neutral (ink),
        never Marigold. The real add-to-cart lives on the PDP (Dawn handles it).
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if state == 'soldout' -%}
        <a href="{{ card_product.url }}" class="ap-card__cta" aria-describedby="{{ title_id }}">
          {{- 'products.card.notify_me' | t -}}
        </a>
      {%- else -%}
        <a href="{{ card_product.url }}" class="ap-card__cta" aria-describedby="{{ title_id }}">
          {{- 'products.card.view_piece' | t -}}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
